stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Available : created by Admin<br/>(Admin/Animals/Edit - status is a form field)
    [*] --> NotForSale : created by Admin<br/>(Admin/Animals/Edit - status is a form field)

    NotForSale --> Available : staff sets status
    Available --> NotForSale : withdrawn

    Available --> Reserved : set by staff only<br/>(Admin/Stock, Animals/Edit)
    Reserved --> Available : staff releases
    Reserved --> Sold : set by staff only

    Available --> Sold : checkout commits<br/>(SqlOrderStore.ApplyStockChange)
    Sold --> Available : buyer cancels the order<br/>while it is still Placed<br/>(SqlOrderStore.Cancel)

    Sold --> [*]

    note right of Available
        Added to the cart only if
        Status = Available AND the
        animal is at least 4 weeks old.
        ValidateLine repeats both checks
        inside the checkout transaction
        (WITH UPDLOCK, HOLDLOCK).
        An order with an animal also needs
        the buyer's "I am 16 or older".
    end note

    note right of Reserved
        As built, nothing sets Reserved
        automatically - checkout goes
        straight from Available to Sold.
        Staff changes are written to
        AuditLog (Animal.StatusChanged).
    end note

    note left of Sold
        A bonded animal and its partner
        are added to the cart together,
        so both reach Sold in one order -
        and both go back to Available
        if that order is cancelled.
        An animal is never shipped:
        it is picked up in the shop.
    end note
